# Testing Rules

- Follow `docs/TEST_PLAN.md`.
- Test critical user journeys rather than implementation details.
- Cover authentication, catalog discovery, cart behavior, authorization, and responsive layouts.
- Keep test data deterministic.
- Avoid tests dependent on production data.
- Run Playwright tests before marking critical commerce tasks complete.
